<title>POLAND: ESPEBEPE DEBT AMONG 564 CREDITORS.</title>
<headline>ESPEBEPE DEBT AMONG 564 CREDITORS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Espebepe's 74.67 million zloty debt is divided among 564 creditors, the firm said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>In recent weeks Espebepe's stock has been volatile on speculation that a March 14 meeting of the firm's creditors might result in a debt restructuring deal.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
